onal pharmaceuticals.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4389615509886868614/comments/default/261358890260333885'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4389615509886868614/comments/default/261358890260333885'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/05/planes-trains-and-automobiles-none-are.html?showComment=1432712794161#c261358890260333885' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/05/planes-trains-and-automobiles-none-are.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4389615509886868614' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4389615509886868614' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-565790309"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 27, 2015 at 1:46 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5679439723747785795</id><published>2015-05-26T17:32:38.337-06:00</published><updated>2015-05-26T17:32:38.337-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Any Law Enforcement Officer involved in such condu...</title><content type='html'>Any Law Enforcement Officer involved in such conduct should be hunted down like a game animal.  If they try this on me, or anyone in my family, I swear to God above that I will hunt down and wreak vengeance on every costumed thug who was present. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4389615509886868614/comments/default/5679439723747785795'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4389615509886868614/commen