ds/32869165/4389615509886868614/comments/default/5850703378237661275'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4389615509886868614/comments/default/5850703378237661275'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/05/planes-trains-and-automobiles-none-are.html?showComment=1432671713070#c5850703378237661275' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/05/planes-trains-and-automobiles-none-are.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4389615509886868614' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4389615509886868614' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-676186773"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 26, 2015 at 2:21 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4789119913304045792</id><published>2015-05-26T05:41:56.540-06:00</published><updated>2015-05-26T05:41:56.540-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;...secure in the persons and papers...&amp;quot;...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;...secure in the persons and papers...&amp;quot;   ??&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The money they seize from their victims doesn&amp;#39;t begin to fund the whole enterprise.  It only funds its additional expansion.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;We should not be surprised at the grotesque waste, mission creep and abuses of power given how much the federal and several state governments have totally wasted trying to get ObamaCare(tm) web sites running.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;One of the roots a wasteful, foolish, intrusive, thuggish, and sometimes tyrannous government is the ease with which it can create almost unlimited amounts of money out of thin air. Near-infinite money buys near-infinite government, and a bureaucracy that is generously funded can entertain an open-ended dream about how to expand its realm.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Every day more people are coming to the judgment that a carefully organized effort to repair the constitution via the States&amp;#39; power to propose and ratify amendments poses less risk to our liberty and prosperity than the present trajectory of the federal government and especially the federal bureaucracy whose self-published rules carry the weight of law.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The first order of business of an Article V Convention must be to limit government&amp;#39;s ability to create and spend near-infinite amounts of money.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;-- theBuckWheat must remain anonymous.&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4389615509886868614/comments/default/4789119913304045792'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4389615509886868614/comments/default/4789119913304045792'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/05/planes-trains-and-automobiles-none-are.html?showComment=1432640516540#c4789119913304045792' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/05/planes-trains-and-automobiles-none-are.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4389615509886868614' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4389615509886868614' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-291200840"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 26, 2015 at 5:41 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6664902053252679334</id><published>2015-05-25T11:02:50.085-06:00</published><updated>2015-05-25T11:02:50.085-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Look at the bright side, folks. With every theft c...</title><content type='html'>Look at the bright side, folks. With every theft committed, the thugs have created another implacable enemy. That almost looks like their real job - creating enemies that will enjoy putting them up against the wall some day. What&amp;#39;s the old saying, &amp;quot;A conservative is a liberal who has been mugged?&amp;quot; An anarchist is a statist who has been mugged by the state.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4389615509886868614/comments/default/6664902053252679334'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4389615509886868614/comments/default/6664902053252679334'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/05/planes-trains-and-automobiles-none-are.html?showComment=1432573370085#c6664902053252679334' title=''/><author><name>Paul B</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/05/planes-trains-and-automobiles-none-are.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4389615509886868614' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4389615509886868614' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-496871900"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 25, 2015 at 11:02 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8308827770764412094</id><published>2015-05-25T07:32:06.509-06:00</published><updated>2015-05-25T07:32:06.509-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The bottom line is, simple to understand when expr...</title><content type='html'>The bottom line is, simple to understand when expresses honestly. Back in the days of nazi power, the cops and military and the rest who where paid by a government entity. Justified the abuse of the citizens as, &amp;quot;it&amp;#39;s my job, that&amp;#39;s what I&amp;#39;m ordered to do&amp;quot;. The lazy scum did not to do work in the private sector that may lead to them getting dirt under their fingernails. The rest is history, a history of evil straight from Satin himself to destroy millions and millions of people in the most horrific evil and rabid forms of death the sickest minds could devise. The very blueprint of this stain of evilness in human history is being repeated by government paid people, as this story makes soundly clear. The very same words by such government employees are spot on the same, &amp;quot;it&amp;#39;s my job, that I&amp;#39;m ordered to do&amp;quot;. People better wake up fast because it&amp;#39;s now spinning out of control. E.G., the police just murdered 9 men in Waco TX and jailed 170 wittnesses with bail so high none will be able to tell the truth of what happen. JADE HELM 15, is night time training to snatch Americans out of their homes at night by military and police. This is the largest military operation in the history of the United States, on our soil. It will last for no less that 2 months. It&amp;#39;s happening right now in America and America is going to become a Satonic hell hole that will be a huge stain in human history. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4389615509886868614/comments/default/8308827770764412094'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4389615509886868614/comments/default/8308827770764412094'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedo